## FreightCalcAdapter.java

这是唯一贴着你项目类型的文件，`FreightCalc.calc` 的签名如果不是这样，只改这里。

```java
package com.example.freight.golden;

import com.fasterxml.jackson.databind.JsonNode;

import com.example.freight.FreightCalc;
import com.example.freight.FreightReq;

final class FreightCalcAdapter {

    private FreightCalcAdapter() {
    }

    /** 请求 JSON 进，规整过的响应 JSON 出。 */
    static JsonNode invoke(JsonNode requestJson) {
        try {
            FreightReq req = GoldenMasterSupport.MAPPER.treeToValue(requestJson, FreightReq.class);
            Object resp = FreightCalc.calc(req);
            return GoldenMasterSupport.scrub(GoldenMasterSupport.MAPPER.valueToTree(resp));
        } catch (Exception e) {
            throw new IllegalStateException("回放失败：" + requestJson, e);
        }
    }
}
```

## FreightGoldenMasterTest.java —— 老类别

```java
package com.example.freight.golden;

import com.fasterxml.jackson.databind.JsonNode;
import org.junit.jupiter.api.DisplayName;
import org.junit.jupiter.params.ParameterizedTest;
import org.junit.jupiter.params.provider.MethodSource;

import java.nio.file.Path;
import java.util.Optional;
import java.util.stream.Stream;

import static org.junit.jupiter.api.Assertions.assertEquals;
import static org.junit.jupiter.api.Assertions.assertFalse;

@DisplayName("老类别：回放必须与改动前的母版一致")
class FreightGoldenMasterTest {

    static Stream<SampleCase> approvedSamples() {
        return GoldenMasterSupport.samplesWithApproved().stream();
    }

    @ParameterizedTest(name = "{0}")
    @MethodSource("approvedSamples")
    @DisplayName("同一请求回放，输出与 approved 母版一致")
    void replayMatchesApproved(SampleCase sample) {
        String expected = GoldenMasterSupport.canonical(
                GoldenMasterSupport.scrub(GoldenMasterSupport.readJson(sample.approved())));

        JsonNode actualNode = FreightCalcAdapter.invoke(GoldenMasterSupport.readJson(sample.request()));
        String actual = GoldenMasterSupport.canonical(actualNode);

        if (!expected.equals(actual)) {
            Optional<Path> dump = GoldenMasterSupport.writeActual(sample.name(), actual);
            assertEquals(expected, actual,
                    () -> "样本「" + sample.name() + "」的输出和母版不一致。"
                            + "母版：" + sample.approved()
                            + dump.map(p -> "，实际：" + p).orElse("")
                            + "。老路径出现差异 = 这次改动漏出去了，先当回归处理；"
                            + "确认是需求要求的变化再改母版，并在 PR 里说明为什么。");
        }
    }

    @ParameterizedTest(name = "{0}")
    @MethodSource("approvedSamples")
    @DisplayName("回放是幂等的：同一请求连跑两次结果相同")
    void replayIsDeterministic(SampleCase sample) {
        JsonNode request = GoldenMasterSupport.readJson(sample.request());
        String first = GoldenMasterSupport.canonical(FreightCalcAdapter.invoke(request));
        String second = GoldenMasterSupport.canonical(FreightCalcAdapter.invoke(request));

        assertEquals(first, second,
                "两次回放不一致，说明还有没规整掉的易变字段，"
                        + "把字段名加进 GoldenMasterSupport.VOLATILE_FIELDS，录制端同步");
    }

    @org.junit.jupiter.api.Test
    @DisplayName("模板 1032 + 广东：进了新路径但不在偏远表里，必须原样复现母版")
    void templateWithRemoteTable_nonRemoteProvince_unchanged() {
        SampleCase sample = GoldenMasterSupport.sample("首重续重-广东");
        String expected = GoldenMasterSupport.canonical(
                GoldenMasterSupport.scrub(GoldenMasterSupport.readJson(sample.approved())));
        String actual = GoldenMasterSupport.canonical(
                FreightCalcAdapter.invoke(GoldenMasterSupport.readJson(sample.request())));

        assertEquals(expected, actual,
                "1032 配了偏远省份表，广东不在表中，附加应为 0；"
                        + "这条一旦红，就是新路径把非偏远请求算错了");
        assertFalse(actual.contains("偏远"),
                "非偏远省份不该出现偏远附加的明细行");
    }
}
```

最后那条单独写出来，是因为它盯的是「新路径的零值分支不改变老行为」这一句需求，参数化跑挂了看不出是哪一句。

## FreightRemoteSurchargeTest.java —— 新类别

新类别**不生成 approved 文件**。母版的意思是「改动前的既有行为」，新路径改动前没有行为可锁；拿代码当前输出去 approve，等于给还没验证的东西盖章。期望值只能来自需求翻译的例子，写成独立字面值。

```java
package com.example.freight.golden;

import com.fasterxml.jackson.databind.JsonNode;
import org.junit.jupiter.api.DisplayName;
import org.junit.jupiter.api.Test;

import java.math.BigDecimal;

import static org.junit.jupiter.api.Assertions.assertEquals;
import static org.junit.jupiter.api.Assertions.assertTrue;

@DisplayName("新类别：偏远附加按省份查表（比需求例子，不比母版）")
class FreightRemoteSurchargeTest {

    /**
     * 需求翻译例子：模板 1032（配了偏远省份表）、新疆（在表中）、3.2kg、vip → 26。
     * 26 是从需求抄来的字面值，不是从代码跑出来的。
     */
    @Test
    @DisplayName("模板1032 + 新疆(在偏远表中) + 3.2kg + vip → 总运费 26")
    void remoteProvinceInTable_appliesSurcharge() {
        SampleCase sample = GoldenMasterSupport.sample("首重续重-新疆-vip");
        JsonNode actual = FreightCalcAdapter.invoke(GoldenMasterSupport.readJson(sample.request()));

        BigDecimal fee = actual.get("fee").decimalValue();
        assertEquals(0, new BigDecimal("26").compareTo(fee),
                () -> "需求例子要求 26，实得 " + fee
                        + "；完整输出：" + GoldenMasterSupport.canonical(actual));
    }

    @Test
    @DisplayName("新类别的样本不许有 approved 文件")
    void newCategoryHasNoApprovedFile() {
        assertTrue(GoldenMasterSupport.sample("首重续重-新疆-vip").approved() == null,
                "新路径改动前没有既有行为，不存在母版；"
                        + "要锁成母版得等这条用例通过评审之后，届时它并入老类别");
    }
}
```

`items` 的明细我没断言。需求只说了总额 26，18 是怎么拆到偏远附加 / vip 上的，需求例子没写——断言没写的东西就是拿实现当规格了。真要断言，得先让需求把那一行的名字和金额写出来。

